SDD Registry for agente-tramites-gobmx
======================================
Initialized: 2026-08-26
Mode: hybrid (Engram + OpenSpec)
Bootstrap config: openspec/config.yaml
Testing capabilities: persisted to Engram as sdd/agente-tramites-gobmx/testing-capabilities

SDD Phases:
  1. explore    — codebase investigation, symbol discovery
  2. propose    — change proposal with intent, scope, approach
  3. spec       — detailed delta specs with requirements + scenarios
  4. design     — technical design and architecture approach
  5. tasks      — break spec into implementation tasks
  6. apply      — implement code changes from tasks
  7. verify     — validate implementation against specs
  8. archive    — sync delta specs, persist artifacts

Active skills registry: .atl/skill-registry.md
